# Force LF in every working tree, including Windows runners (autocrlf there
# rewrote sources to CRLF, which broke the source-string tripwire tests and
# any byte-length assertion). Binary-ish assets are excluded below.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
